    <img class="hero-photo--solar" src="{{ hero_solar }}" width="1944" height="809" decoding="async" alt="Generated photograph looking along the underside of a solar canopy with paired steel support columns.">
  </figure>
  <div class="hero-title">
    <p class="mono">Anomaly detection for physical &amp; digital systems</p>
    <h1 id="headline">Every system has a pattern.</h1>
    <p class="hero-promise">Detect when it changes.</p>
    <div class="hero-summary">
      <p>Continuous anomaly detection for sensor telemetry<br>and digital data streams.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="#platform">Explore the platform <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14m-6-6 6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section container" id="platform" aria-labelledby="platform-title"><div class="section-intro"><div class="section-label mono"><b>01 /</b> The platform</div><div><h2 id="platform-title">From raw signal.<br><span class="muted">To meaningful deviation.</span></h2><p>A continuous path from connected telemetry to evidence you can act on. Built around the relationships in your data.</p></div></div>
<div class="pipeline">
<article class="step"><div class="step-top mono"><span>01 / Connect</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>Read the system.</h3><p>Bring your data streams together. Observe measurements in the context of the system they belong to.</p><svg class="step-visual" viewBox="0 0 240 76" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#62666a">
<path d="M0 20h50l30 18h55M0 56h50l30-18M135 38h90"/>
<path d="M0 38h135"/></g><g fill="#bcbfc2"><circle cx="50" cy="20" r="2"/><circle cx="50" cy="56" r="2"/><circle cx="135" cy="38" r="3"/></g>
<path d="M210 31l8 7-8 7" fill="none" stroke="#bcbfc2"/></svg></article>
<article class="step"><div class="step-top mono"><span>02 / Calibrate</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>Define normal.</h3><p>Learn from baseline data. Calibrate anomaly scores with conformal methods to establish a meaningful reference.</p><svg class="step-visual" viewBox="0 0 240 76" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M0 55H240M0 19H240" stroke="#43464a" stroke-dasharray="3 5"/>
<path d="M0 37l15 3 15-7 15 4 15-6 15 9 15-6 15 4 15-2 15 7 15-11 15 4 15-4 15 7 15-2 15 3 15-7" fill="none" stroke="#a8adb2"/></svg></article>
<article class="step"><div class="step-top mono"><span>03 / Detect</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>Find the break.</h3><p>Accumulate evidence as observations arrive. Surface changes that depart from the calibrated baseline.</p><svg class="step-visual" viewBox="0 0 240 76" aria-hidden="true">
<path d="M0 50H240" stroke="#43464a"/>
<path d="M0 40l20-3 20 6 20-4 20 3 20-6 20 4 20-7 15 3" fill="none" stroke="#9a9fa4"/>
<path d="M155 36l15-25 15 9 15-15 20 8 20-4" stroke="#d69b7b" fill="none"/>
<path d="M155 0v76" stroke="#d69b7b" stroke-opacity=".5" stroke-dasharray="2 5"/></svg></article>
<article class="step"><div class="step-top mono"><span>04 / Understand</span><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><h3>Follow the evidence.</h3><p>Review detected changes alongside the telemetry behind them. Move from an anomaly to a clearer picture.</p><svg class="step-visual" viewBox="0 0 240 76" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="#45494d">
<path d="M0 15h70v4H0zM0 36h115v4H0zM0 57h48v4H0z"/></g>
<path d="M0 36h175v4H0z" fill="#a8adb2"/>
<path d="M190 38l5 5 12-12" fill="none" stroke="#d69b7b"/></svg></article>
</div></section>
