<section class="section container research" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title"><div class="section-label mono"><b>03 /</b> The approach</div><div><h2 id="method-title">Statistical rigor.<br><span class="muted">Operational reality.</span></h2><p>Detection is more than an unusual data point. Aberration brings streaming pipelines, conformal calibration, and accumulated evidence into one system. So you can investigate change with a meaningful reference.</p>{% if docs_base_url | default('') %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ docs_base_url | e }}/user-guide/monitoring/">Explore the documentation <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
